WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.986
Launch Copilot CLI first.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.277
Ask Copilot something first.

00:00:09.277 --> 00:00:13.709
Here, we ask for the latest LTS version of Node.js.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.277
Copilot thinks, then runs a web search for the answer.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:32.130
While it works, type /undo to rewind the last turn.

00:00:32.528 --> 00:00:36.296
It is queued; once done, a rewind picker appears.
